<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- THE TRANSLATION FILE OF THE CHINESE EDITION ("cn" build type, package io.github.chronosauros.contour.cn). It replaces src/main/res/values/strings.xml for that build only: every key of the
     main file is here. Simplified Chinese written by Opus and reviewed by a second model; terms follow the glossary of contoureq.app (zh). Generated from main + the translation table, keep keys and %1$s %2$d arguments. -->
